--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -5,6 +5,12 @@ Version 8.3.3
 
 Unreleased
 
+-   The "Try '... --help' for help." hint in usage errors suggests a name the
+    help option actually has, instead of always the first entry in
+    ``help_option_names``, which may be shadowed by one of the command's own
+    parameters. ``Command.get_help_option_names`` now also keeps the order of
+    ``help_option_names`` rather than returning them in an arbitrary order.
+    :issue:`2790`
 -   Use :func:`shlex.split` to split pager and editor commands into ``argv``
     lists for :class:`subprocess.Popen`, removing ``shell=True``.
     :issue:`1026` :pr:`1477` :pr:`2775`
